`mem_sUnion_coe_iff` is axiom-free: it is a pair of `rintro`/`exact` steps over
`Set.mem_sUnion` and `Set.mem_image`, with no choice, no quotient and no
propositional extensionality. Everywhere else `Classical.choice` arrives through
`IdealCompletion`'s `idealSup`, whose `dite` branches on the undecidable
`Order.IsIdeal`, through the `open Classical in` that gives `Finset.filter` and
`Finset.image` their `Decidable` instances in `smythJoin`, and — in the
refutations — through `Set.Countable.to_subtype` behind `Domain (Set ℕ)`. -/
